"""A small estimate for adjective-like modifiers in a determiner phrase.

Large sampled responses often followed "the" or a possessive, and were
usually positive on descriptive modifiers.  Cardinal words and person nouns
could be negative.  The suffix tests are only rough word-class clues, so the
predicted size is intentionally modest and other contexts are zero.
