"""Approximate activations for a few recurring relation-word patterns.

This component is often positive on English prepositions and relation markers.
The stable lexical cues are “by” and “per”; unusually large “to” values
in the observed text followed “according”, while “on” followed “based” or
“depends”. This small rule leaves other words and contexts at zero.
